# Optional: custom database location.
#
# You do NOT need this file. `bun run db:push` computes the location itself
# (<project root>/db/custom.db) and the app falls back to the same file when
# DATABASE_URL is unset.
#
# If you set DATABASE_URL, use an ABSOLUTE path so the Prisma CLI and the app
# agree on the file (the CLI resolves relative `file:` paths against the
# prisma/ folder, the app against the project root):
#
# Windows:  DATABASE_URL=file:C:/absolute/path/to/custom.db
# macOS:    DATABASE_URL=file:/absolute/path/to/custom.db
# Linux:    DATABASE_URL=file:/absolute/path/to/custom.db
#
# Copy this file to .env if you want to override the default location.
